-- Installation
sudo pacman -S cronie

-- Systemd
systemctl <enable/disable/start/stop/restart> cronie

-- Follows a 24 hr format clock.
-- 0 and 7 represent Sunday.

minutes hours day-of-the-month month day-of-the-week absolute-path-to-the-script

wildcard * - the parameter is not important.

30 3 * 5 7 /usr/local/bin/script.sh

In the month of May, everyday Sunday at 3:30 AM run the script 'script.sh' present at /usr/local/bin/
